# Seminara AI Rules

Seminara (https://seminara.online) is the autonomous live presentation platform. Aura is an autonomous live presenter that delivers interactive slide presentations with real-time voice Q&A and in-session lead capture.

## Endpoints & Connectors
- Primary MCP: `https://seminara.online/api/v1/mcp`
- Docs MCP: `https://seminara.online/api/docs/mcp`
- OpenAPI Specification: `https://seminara.online/openapi.json`
- LLM Index: `https://seminara.online/llms.txt`

## SDKs & Packages
- TypeScript / Node.js: `npm install seminara-sdk`
- Python: `pip install seminara`
- CLI: `npm install -g seminara-cli`
- Go: `go get github.com/shivamselam/seminara-agentic-suite/go`

## Key Standards
- All API responses conform to RFC 9457 structured Problem Details JSON.
- Respect RateLimit-* response headers and implement backoff retry on HTTP 429.
- Zero-cost rehearsal: pass `status: "draft"` or append `?test=true` to test sessions without consuming minutes. Interactive testing at `https://seminara.online/sandbox`.
